<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porcīnus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>of a hog</i>, <i>hog's</i>, <i>swine's</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">polimenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 1, 3, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 2, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. Frag. 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caro, porcina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Macc. 6, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porcīna</span></b> , ae, f. (sc.
			caro), <i>swine's flesh</i>, <i>pork</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 4, 2, 69</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 1, 11, 95</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in milit. lang.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porcinum caput,</span>”
				<i>a swine's head</i>, <i>a wedge-shaped order of
						battle</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 3, 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
